## Step 1: Document and verify the existing API

The backend remains Express on port `3000`. These are the frontend-relevant contracts.

| Method | Endpoint | Success response |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/me` | `{ user: { userId, email, username, subscriptionStatus } }` |
| `POST` | `/api/create-checkout-session` | `{ url }` |
| `GET` | `/api/checkout/confirm?session_id=...` | `{ status: "active" }` |
| `GET` | `/auth/google` | Redirects to Google |
| `GET` | `/auth/logout` | `{ error: "Logged out successfully" }` |
| `POST` | `/games/start` | `{ gameId, imageId, roundId, roundNumber }` |
| `POST` | `/games/:gameId/rounds/:roundId/guess` | `{ distance, guessLocation, actualLocation, newRoundData }` |
| `GET` | `/games/:gameId/score` | `{ totalDistance }` |
| `GET` | `/streetview/access-token` | `{ accessToken }` |
| `POST` | `/streetview/ai-review` | `{ text }` |

The guess request body is:

```json
{
  "guessLat": 43.65,
  "guessLng": -79.38
}
```

The AI request body is:

```json
